Z||000000||Roy||05-08-99||10:15 PM||||My dad was going through his garage today, and he found a 63 aluminum buick v8. He had no need for it and said he was just going to throw it away. I thougth hey wouldnt it be great if I could get this thing into my 84 fiero. The only problem is, I can't figure out where to locate any information on a conversion, nor parts to do it. Are there any pages? The great thing about this engine is it was built to be used in land rovers, they made a small quanity of them, and it weighs the same if not less than the stock 4cyl in my 84 Se right now.
